---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Thank You" bare>
  <section class="page-hero" data-animate>
    <h1 class="page-h1">
      Thank You!
      <span class="page-h1-ar">شكرًا لكم!</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="page-tag">
      Your message has been received. A leader will get back to you shortly.
    </p>
    <p class="page-tag-ar">
      تم استلام رسالتكم. سيتواصل معكم أحد القادة قريبًا.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-cta" style="justify-content: center; margin-top: 2rem;">
      <a class="btn-primary" href="/">Back to Home</a>
      <a class="btn-secondary" href="/about-us">Learn More</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
